===Etymology===
{{suffix|en|alcohol|ism}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|-|s}}

# {{lb|en|pathology}} A [[chronic]] [[disease]] caused by [[compulsive]] and uncontrollable consumption of [[alcohol]]ic [[beverage]]s, leading to [[addiction]] and deterioration in health and social functioning.
# {{lb|en|pathology}} Acute [[alcohol poisoning]].

